    "text": "A particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> and charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>μC</mi></math> is projected towards a non conducting fixed spherical shell having the same charge uniformly distributed on its surface. The minimum initial velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math> of projection of particle required if the particle just grazes the shell is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image1-21a53ed6-562a-4024-869c-aac87bbda3d7.jpg\" />",
