  "solution": {
    "text": "From conservation of angular momentum,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>mvr</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />From conservation of energy,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#1013;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
